{"object_id": "demo:6413", "kind": "demo", "text": "咱不说舔狗和理中客的问题，就说这组织力，就不一样，这次的立法可见一斑。举个例子，去年二月，女拳集体冲霹雳霹雳（B站）那次，组织力度之强，声势浩大，都没见过，而且从各方面下手懂得冲合作方，懂得影响股市、带动舆论。而起因仅仅是B站为了平息风波，各打五十大板，既下架了那部动画，又封了那个舔饭圈和女拳的LexBurner，就被骂“辱女”了。它们的口号：LexBurner可以因为辱女被封，但是不能因为舔它们被封。与之相比，微博上连“鲨光男人”都说得出来，别说冲了，骂都没几个人骂过。所以，短时间内，男性会被女性压着，直到在忍耐中爆发", "text_sha256": "8173e9a03bece6f26b3c272ec09d047a2e2881392d56f7af54fd33145bf39903", "base_version": 0, "prior_label_reference": {"batch": 6, "values": {"hate": "hate", "group": ["Sexism", "others"]}, "review_kind": "ai_note", "field_provenance": {"hate": "ai_note", "group": "ai_note"}, "task_policies": {"hate": {"sha256": "53be85f067db620137f8e28e1ad8dba4963da0810ba99576ad1138a9ef96cb97", "version": "evidence-applicability-annotation-policy/v2"}, "group": {"version": "evidence-applicability-annotation-policy/v2+personal-insult-others.1", "sha256": "c9af65f3ab260493c9f86e1b6274d3ac09259f3e9beda78989aa8870ea6e1f9d"}}, "human_rationale": null, "artifact": {"path": "discussions/batch-06/initial-label-reference/labels-06.json", "sha256": "db5bd87d5eeccc87900ed9369033015a41ad7ca394d89dbab6dadeaa95be0d59"}}}
